{"id":"d5e58e9c7650c0d7","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-ana-normed-vector-space.md","title":"ZFC Ana Normed Vector Space","display":"df-zfc-ana-normed-vector-space — ZFC Ana Normed Vector Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ana-normed-vector-space","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ana-normed-vector-space"],"display":"df-zfc-ana-normed-vector-space — ZFC Ana Normed Vector Space","depends_on":["[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ana-normed-vector-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ana-normed-vector-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ana-normed-vector-space — ZFC Ana Normed Vector Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V,K,+_V,\\odot,\\nu \\in\\mathbf V\">\\(V,K,+_V,\\odot,\\nu \\in\\mathbf V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\">\\(K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAnaNormedVectorSpace}_S \\subseteq\\mathbf V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAnaNormedVectorSpace}_S \\subseteq\\mathbf V^5\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ana\\text{-}normed\\text{-}vector\\text{-}space}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcAnaNormedVectorSpace}_S(V,K,+_V,\\odot,\\nu)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nK\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\n\\land\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_K(V,+_V,\\odot)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\nu,V,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists 0_V\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\forall x\\in V\\;(0_V+_Vx=x=x+_V0_V)\n\\land\\forall x\\in V\\;(\\nu(x)=0\\leftrightarrow x=0_V)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in K\\;\\forall x\\in V\\;\n\\nu(a\\odot x)=|a|\\,\\nu(x)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in V\\;\n\\nu(x+_Vy)\\leq\\nu(x)+\\nu(y).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ana\\text{-}normed\\text{-}vector\\text{-}space}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcAnaNormedVectorSpace}_S(V,K,+_V,\\odot,\\nu)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nK\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\n\\land\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_K(V,+_V,\\odot)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\nu,V,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists 0_V\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\forall x\\in V\\;(0_V+_Vx=x=x+_V0_V)\n\\land\\forall x\\in V\\;(\\nu(x)=0\\leftrightarrow x=0_V)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in K\\;\\forall x\\in V\\;\n\\nu(a\\odot x)=|a|\\,\\nu(x)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in V\\;\n\\nu(x+_Vy)\\leq\\nu(x)+\\nu(y).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The carrier operations are explicit parameters and agree with the upstream vector-space interface.</li>\n<li>Positive definiteness, absolute homogeneity, and the triangle inequality have independent, correctly scoped quantifiers.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"V,K,+_V,\\odot,\\nu \\in\\mathbf V","display":false},{"tex":"K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcAnaNormedVectorSpace}_S \\subseteq\\mathbf V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ana\\text{-}normed\\text{-}vector\\text{-}space}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{ZfcAnaNormedVectorSpace}_S(V,K,+_V,\\odot,\\nu)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\nK\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\n\\land\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_K(V,+_V,\\odot)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\nu,V,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\\\\\n&\\land\\exists 0_V\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\forall x\\in V\\;(0_V+_Vx=x=x+_V0_V)\n\\land\\forall x\\in V\\;(\\nu(x)=0\\leftrightarrow x=0_V)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall a\\in K\\;\\forall x\\in V\\;\n\\nu(a\\odot x)=|a|\\,\\nu(x)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in V\\;\n\\nu(x+_Vy)\\leq\\nu(x)+\\nu(y).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1350,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1439","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-ana-normed-vector-space.md|58-df-zfc-ana-normed-vector-space]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["592f9cfb66a507c2","36d7463d215be751"]}